<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83343" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίτνημι</span></b> , poet. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πετάννυμι</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spread out</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠέρα
			πίτνα</span> (
				Ep.
			
			impf.) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιτνὰς εἰς ἐμὲ χεῖρας</span>
			<i>stretching out</i> his arms to me, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.392
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίτναν τ᾽ ἐς αἰθέρα
			χεῖρας</span> (impf.) <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				5.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίτνατε λεπταλέας στολίδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					10.6
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Satyr.
			</span></i>): metaph., <i>excite, flutter</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ λεῖον φαλακρὸν ἡδονῇ πιτνάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					359
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ δὲ χαῖται . . πίτναντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.402
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμέλαι ἐπίτναντο χρυσήλατοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					713
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίτνατο . . παστὸς θαλάμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.711
				</span></i>
			 (Antip.):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίτνω</span></b> , only 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπιτνον ἀλωήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					291
				</span></i>
			.</div>
